harness: scripts/ladder_vs_cjxl.py --cjxl-flags ours (two cjxl-rs builds
         alternated inside each repeat, leading arm flipped per repeat)
command: scripts/ladder_vs_cjxl.py --ours <after> --cjxl <before> --cjxl-flags ours \
           --reps 7 --threads 1 --efforts 3,5,7,9 --distances 1.0 <png>...
host: Darwin 25.5.0 aarch64 (mac)
date: 2026-09-10
change: AccumulatedAnsData stops building its per-token `value_freqs` /
        `lz77_freqs` BTreeMaps when `optimize_uint_configs` is false
        (libjxl `uint_method == kNone`, effort < 9). Columns are named
        after_/before_ (the script's ours_/cjxl_ slots).

  image          e   after_ms  before_ms   ratio   bytes
  plots          3       31        36      0.842   identical
  plots          5      152       158      0.961   identical
  plots          7      196       203      0.966   identical
  plots          9     1107      1106      1.001   identical
  webshot        3       33        38      0.865   identical
  webshot        5      153       160      0.959   identical
  webshot        7      199       205      0.971   identical
